<title>UK: SOCCER-CELTIC CLOSE THE GAP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CELTIC CLOSE THE GAP.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celtic moved to within four points of Glasgow Rangers at the top of the Scottish premier league with a comfortable 2-0 win over bottom club Raith on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Celtic goals came from Paolo Di Canio in the 47th minute and Jorge Cadete 10 minutes from the end.</p>
<p>Rangers are on 61 points but have played a game fewer than Celtic.</p>
</text>
